From 2205b40ec1e690f2644f54750df166f4f6c9b2d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jan Pietek <jan.pietek@amagi.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Apr 2026 11:36:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/20] avfilter/overlay_many_cuda: optimize CUDA compositing

Switch overlay_many_cuda to read from source frames and write into a separate output buffer, replace float alpha blending with integer math, and add combined kernels for the 420 and 444 fast paths to cut per-plane launch overhead.

Keep the kernel generator and generated CUDA source in sync with the new combined and 420-to-420 chroma paths.
---
 libavfilter/vf_overlay_many_cuda.cu | 8906 ++++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 6598 insertions(+), 2308 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libavfilter/vf_overlay_many_cuda.cu b/libavfilter/vf_overlay_many_cuda.cu
index e513e4f..ae4136f 100644
--- a/libavfilter/vf_overlay_many_cuda.cu
+++ b/libavfilter/vf_overlay_many_cuda.cu
@@ -4,2627 +4,6917 @@ extern "C" {
 
 
 __global__ void AlignedOverlay__2(
